Added more comments to the rumors file. 
	1) Trapdoors (or any other traps) may exist under objects. 
	2) Monsters of softening penetration are xans.  They soften
		your legs and weaken your carrying ability. 
	3) A crysknife IS the best weapon vs. small monsters. 
		Against large monsters, the crysknife is the best weapon
		available if you are wearing a shield and cannot wield
		a two-handed sword. 
	4) The dungeon collapses around you when you try to restore 
		a faulty Saved game.  Better luck next time!
	5) Not only wizards can use magic whistles.  My caveman used
		one all the time to teleport his dog around.
	6) Talk of leprecahuns rooms vs. Magic Memory vaults are 
		probably false.  Leprechauns tend to keep all the gold
		that they have stolen on their person.  When I kill
		a leprechaun, I always recovered all of the gold I've lost.
	7) Does "Speed kills" warn against quaffing two potions of speed?
		NO! when you do that, 'your legs agin new energy'

